---
/**
 * Four-dimension trend matrix cards.
 */
---
<div class="section-head">
  <div>
    <span class="kicker">FOUR-DIMENSION TREND GATE</span>
    <h2>四维趋势矩阵</h2>
  </div>
  <p>同一份<span id="matrix-pool-size">ETF</span>池快照 · 不重复计算相关指标</p>
</div>
<section class="matrix">
  <article class="metric card" id="m-breadth">
    <div class="metric-top"><span>市场广度</span><b id="breadth-state">—</b></div>
    <h3 id="breadth-value">—</h3>
    <p id="breadth-detail">趋势通过率与扩散方向</p>
    <small id="breadth-impact">等待数据</small>
  </article>
  <article class="metric card" id="m-relative">
    <div class="metric-top"><span>相对强度</span><b id="relative-state">—</b></div>
    <h3 id="relative-value">—</h3>
    <p id="relative-detail">跑赢SPY的ETF数量</p>
    <small id="relative-impact">等待数据</small>
  </article>
  <article class="metric card" id="m-quality">
    <div class="metric-top"><span>趋势质量</span><b id="quality-state">—</b></div>
    <h3 id="quality-value">—</h3>
    <p id="quality-detail">A级趋势与量价确认</p>
    <small id="quality-impact">等待数据</small>
  </article>
  <article class="metric card" id="m-risk">
    <div class="metric-top"><span>交易风险</span><b id="risk-state">—</b></div>
    <h3 id="risk-value">—</h3>
    <p id="risk-detail">过热、破位与禁止追高</p>
    <small id="risk-impact">等待数据</small>
  </article>
</section>
